<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Prague bourse announces changes to PX50 index.</title>
<headline>Prague bourse announces changes to PX50 index.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Prague Stock Exchange (PSE) said on Friday that it had approved the replacement of three issues on the PX50 index with effect from January 6, 1997.</p>
<p>Shares to be removed from the index are, aircraft production holding company Aero Holding a.s., ocean shipper Ceskoslovenska Namorni Plavba a.s., glass fibre maker Vertex a.s..</p>
<p>Shares to be added to the index are, fats and edible oils producer Milo Olomouc a.s., heating utility Moravskoslezske Teplarny a.s and steel producer Vitkovice a.s..</p>
<p>The PSE meets to discuss changes to its indices every three months.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
